  "reviewDecisions": [
    "Measured >=4CPU/>=14GiB build hosts: four build workers, two sync workers, one concurrent link; not a completion/OOM guarantee",
    "Non-official non-debug non-component builds, PGO0 and ThinLTO false, symbols0; sandbox and security controls retained",
    "Symbols0 reduces engine stack completeness; app PDB retention is independent",
    "Mac ARM is cross-built on the measured Intel host and requires separate native ARM acceptance",
    "Windows maps force actual VS2026 path/version and Windows Kits root; pinned Chromium requires SDK28000; no older SDK/VS fallback",
    "Native tool inventories are representative measured files, not hermetic installation inventories",
    "Linux and Intel Mac disk headroom and 300-minute cold-build budget are risks; failures retain truthful diagnostics",
    "Per-target release descriptors may pin different source locks; never rebind the existing local Windows bundle to this new six-target lock"
  ],
